> 14. Write a paragraph summarizing your conclusions from this study. Be sure to discuss both what you learned from the sample and what you believe to be plausible about the population.

Based on the sample median, there is evidence that median percentage of body weight for backpacks in the population of university students is different than 10%, in fact there is evidence that the population median is less than 10%.

